        "original_id": "944a643f-acfc-5048-938e-1dceb5b1c637",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Callis, David Eick\n- Characters: Gaius Baltar, Richard Adar, Count Baltar\n- TV Series: Eureka, Battlestar Galactica\n- Networks: Syfy\n\nFacts:\n- Eureka is an American science fiction television series that premiered on Syfy on July 18, 2006.\n- In 2010, James Callis joined the cast of the Syfy television series Eureka.\n- Dr. Gaius Baltar is a fictional character in the television series Battlestar Galactica, and James Callis portrays him.\n- Dr. Gaius Baltar is a reimagining of Count Baltar from the 1978 Battlestar Galactica series.\n- In the Battlestar Galactica miniseries, Richard Adar was portrayed in a still picture in Doctor Gaius Baltar's house by producer David Eick in age-enhancing make-up.",
